  "details": "Good day!\nSuch problem. Already on the boot screen and then a very low fps. The sound from my microphone is correct, without lags. The sound in the headphones is also stable. Moreover, neither the processor nor the graphics card nor the RAM do not load more than 40 %. In parallel, I can even run DOOM (60 fps consistently). \nTwo months ago, there was no problem. It's impossible to play now.\n\nThe parameters of the comp:\nRAM: 8 GB\nVCard: GTX 1060 6gb\nProcessor: FX 8350\nWindows 10\n\nHelp me plz!",
